  "abstract": "Confirm Idea 3 on a stronger fixed-ramp baseline: Fourier LN ScalarRamp with H=160 (learn_gamma=False), adding a horizon-wise population-mean alignment penalty \u03bb_pop=1e\u22123 on top of MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e\u22124). Tests whether the larger H improves robustness of the observed gain.",
